### 2. Get my latest application
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/author-applications/me/latest
x-client-id: {{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 3. Submit again -> should fail with 409 if active app exists
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/author-applications
x-client-id: {{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

