### 4. Admin list pending applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/admin/author-applications?status=PENDING&page=1&limit=20
x-client-id: {{adminId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. Admin get detail for application 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/admin/author-applications/1
x-client-id: {{adminId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Admin mark under review
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/admin/author-applications/1/mark-under-review
x-client-id: {{adminId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. User withdraw application 1
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/author-applications/1/withdraw
x-client-id: {{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 8. Submit again after withdraw
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/author-applications
x-client-id: {{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

